    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="19">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 19</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Hælnesgrið and hadgrið healde man mid rihte æfre swyþe georne, and Godes lagum fylge 7 lareowum hlyste, swa þærto gebyrige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The security and ecclesiastical privileges of the sanctuary are always to be observed most assiduously according to the law, and God’s laws are to be followed and teachers are to be heeded, as is appropriate to them.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Hælnesgrið 7 hadgrið healde man mid rihte æfre swyþe georne 7 Godes lagum fylge 7 lareowum hlyste, swa þærto gebyrige.</ab>
      </div>
